@startuml
title Defense Core — Conceptual Domain Model
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class "Workflow Definition" as WorkflowDefinition <<definition>> {
  identity
  designated start
}

class "Task Definition" as TaskDefinition <<definition>> {
  identity
  name
  positive maximum-total-attempt bound
}

class "Transition" as Transition <<definition>> {
  condition: SUCCESS | FAILURE | ALWAYS
}

class "Named Scenario" as Scenario <<deterministic input>> {
  identity
  finite outcome sequence by task
}

class "Workflow Run" as WorkflowRun <<run state>> {
  identity
  mode
  scenario identity
  run status
}

class "Task Attempt / Execution State" as TaskAttempt <<run state>> {
  attempt ordinal
  outcome
  retry count
  timing observations
}

class "Trace Entry" as TraceEntry <<run state>> {
  run-local order
  observation kind
  observation data
}

WorkflowDefinition "1" *-- "1..*" TaskDefinition : defines
WorkflowDefinition "1" *-- "0..*" Transition : connects
Transition "0..*" --> "1" TaskDefinition : from task
Transition "0..*" --> "1" TaskDefinition : to task
WorkflowDefinition "1" <-- "0..*" WorkflowRun : executes accepted definition
Scenario "1" <-- "0..*" WorkflowRun : selects
WorkflowRun "1" *-- "0..*" TaskAttempt : owns
TaskDefinition "1" <-- "0..*" TaskAttempt : attempt of
WorkflowRun "1" *-- "1..*" TraceEntry : ordered evidence
TaskAttempt "0..1" <-- "0..*" TraceEntry : may describe
Transition "0..1" <-- "0..*" TraceEntry : may record selection

note right of WorkflowDefinition
Exactly one designated start.
Conditional DAG only.
All tasks reachable; terminal reachable.
end note

note right of TaskDefinition
Reusable, execution-immutable definition data.
Neither strategy mutates it during a run.
No mutable run status, attempt/retry count,
timestamps, selected transition,
trace position, or terminal state.
end note

note bottom of WorkflowRun
All mutable attempt, retry, transition,
trace, and terminal state belongs to one run.
Sequential and concurrent runs are isolated.
end note

